            "Throw the bubble to the slot",
            "Hand off anyway",
            "Kneel",
            "Punt"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "With the nickel in the box, the slot is uncovered: throw it.",
          "concept": "rpo"
        },
        {
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "id": "c5-rpo-05",
          "prompt": "The nickel stays out over the slot. What does the quarterback do?",
          "choices": [
            "Hand off",
            "Throw the bubble",
            "Spike it",
            "Run backwards"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "With the nickel out, the box has one fewer defender: hand off.",
          "concept": "rpo"
        },
        {
          "type": "true_false",
          "id": "c5-rpo-06",
          "statement": "On an RPO, offensive linemen block as if it's a run.",
          "answer": true,
          "explanation": "They run-block, which is why the pass has to come out quickly: linemen can't be far downfield on a pass.",
          "concept": "rpo"
        }
